  "description": "Get ready to dominate the streets and trails with the Reid Harbour 250W, the pinnacle of cool in electric biking! This sleek machine, inspired by mini motocross bikes, isn't just a way to get around – it's a bold statement of style and adventure. Its 20\" low-step frame makes it incredibly versatile and easy to store. Imagine yourself cruising through city streets, effortlessly commanding any incline with the incredible power of the Ananda R210 36V 250W rear hub motor.\nThe robust 48V 15Ah battery gives you the extended range you need for all your load-lugging adventures, while the Ananda D19 bluetooth display, provides clear ride data and app compatibility. As you zip through urban landscapes, picture the thrill of tackling challenging off-road paths, thanks to the aggressive 20x4.0\" tires on 36H 80mm alloy rims and confidence-inspiring Tektro HD M275 hydraulic disc brakes. The Uding D9 fork with 80mm travel smooths out the bumps, ensuring a comfortable ride.\nYou'll have precise control with the L-TWOO 7-speed gearing, featuring a Shimano TY200 rear derailleur and a Shimano 7-speed 14-28T freewheel, powered by a Prowheel alloy 48T 170mm crankset. Rider comfort is ensured with a Reid comfort saddle, Alloy 30.9mm 400mm seatpost, and Reid ergo lock-on grips on a 700mm 150mm rise alloy handlebar with a 45mm alloy stem. The alloy platform pedals provide a secure footing.\nWhether you're conquering rugged trails or making a grand entrance at your favorite spot, the Reid Harbour 250W is your pass to unforgettable experiences. The Reid Harbour 250W isn't just a bike; it's an invitation to redefine your ride, embrace your cool, and explore a world of thrilling possibilities with serious power.\n\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike and eScooter safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
